        "created_at": "2015-10-23T19:21:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>Long time reader, first time poster.</p><p>First of all to everybody: what a marvelous job you all have been doing coming op with al those theories, they are a delight to read.</p><p>But to go to the point, while I was playing against Apostate, I saw the art on the card 'Relic Spirit'. It resembles Kaarga Warfang quite well in my opinion. What do you think?&nbsp;Any ideas about the possibility that this is indeed Kaarga Warfang? Could it fit in&nbsp;the Multiverse?</p>",
