        "id": 149871,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-23T19:47:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The similarities are definitely interesting.</p><p>I don't know if there are other's of Kaargra's race around or not, we don't see any, but the style is remarkably similar in poise and facial structure. &nbsp;I doubt it would be Kaargra though.</p><p>My initial thoughts are it would be coincidence, and the gill-like slots are noticably missing from the Relic Spirit.</p><p>However it could be possible that relic spirits come from her people, or are made from them or something. &nbsp;Nightmist makes no appearance in the Warfang or Title deck, so there's no sign she would be there to question it.</p><p>It is an interesting observation, and welcome to the forums.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:28:25.131Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
