        "cooked": "<p>There is also the fact in her bio there is this rumor.</p><p>\n&gt; </p><p><span>Others say that Kaargra struck a deal with some unfathomable cosmic entity, trading the portion of her soul that knew of mercy and kindness in exchange for power and a realm of her own in the form of the Bloodsworn Colosseum</span></p><p><span>\n</span></p><p><span>it is called a Relic Spirit and Kaarga possibly gave up part of her soul.</span></p>",
